<title>UK: Refuge has 91.5 pct of Utd Friendly.</title>
<headline>Refuge has 91.5 pct of Utd Friendly.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Refuge said on Friday it held 91.5 percent of ordinary shares and 71.6 percent of of B shares in bid target United Friendly.</p>
<p>Refuge said the merger offers remain open for acceptance of confirmation until October 16, when Refuge shareholders meet to approve the merger.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
